.TH PACKAGE-CLEANER-GUI 1 "October 2026" "Package Cleaner @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
package-cleaner-gui \- graphical software cleanup review
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B package-cleaner-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the native GTK interface. Queueing records an intention, not authorization.
Removal requires fresh validation and a separate final confirmation.
The interface must run as an unprivileged user.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR package-cleaner (1)
